      "id": "open",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "No finish exit (crash after claim, webhook never arrives, dropped registry webhook): the row stays in_flight and holds that wallet's queue. No timeout. No reaper.\nHubSymbolRegisteringSucceededEvent does not finish the row. A finish exit with no matching in_flight row changes nothing.",
      "originalText": "No finish exit (crash after claim, webhook never arrives, dropped registry webhook): the row stays in_flight and holds that wallet's queue. No timeout. No reaper.\nHubSymbolRegisteringSucceededEvent does not finish the row. A finish exit with no matching in_flight row changes nothing.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
